@startuml despliegue
!pragma layout smetana
!include estilo.iuml
title Diagrama de Despliegue – SRB arquitectura base (2 máquinas)

node "<<device>>\nMáquina 1 – Capa de Consumidores\nIP: 192.168.1.10" as M1 {
  node "<<execution environment>>\nPython 3.11+ / pyzmq" as EE1 {
    artifact "cliente.py\n<<proceso>> Cliente C1\nPULL :6001" as C1
    artifact "cliente.py\n<<proceso>> Cliente C2\nPULL :6002" as C2
    artifact "cliente.py\n<<proceso>> Cliente Cn\nPULL :600n" as CN
  }
  artifact "config.json" as CFG1
  artifact "carga/*.json\n(scripts de entrada)" as SCR
  artifact "resultados/metricas_Cx.csv" as MET1
}

node "<<device>>\nMáquina 2 – Capas de Negocio y Almacenamiento\nIP: 192.168.1.20" as M2 {
  node "<<execution environment>>\nPython 3.11+ / pyzmq" as EE2 {
    artifact "gestor_transacciones.py\nROUTER :5555 | PULL :5556" as GT
    artifact "rmc.py\nREP :5557" as RMC
    artifact "cancelaciones.py\nPULL :5558" as CAN
    artifact "persistencia.py\nREP :5559" as PER
  }
  database "srb.db\n<<SQLite>>" as DB
  artifact "config.json" as CFG2
  artifact "datos/eventos_iniciales.json" as INI
  artifact "resultados/tpm_gestor.csv" as MET2
}

C1 --> GT : <<ZeroMQ/TCP>>\nREQ-ROUTER :5555
C1 ..> GT : <<ZeroMQ/TCP>>\nPUSH-PULL :5556
C2 --> GT
CN --> GT
GT --> RMC : <<ZeroMQ/TCP localhost>>\nDEALER-REP :5557
GT ..> CAN : <<ZeroMQ/TCP localhost>>\nPUSH-PULL :5558
RMC --> PER : <<ZeroMQ/TCP localhost>>\nREQ-REP :5559
CAN --> PER : <<ZeroMQ/TCP localhost>>\nREQ-REP :5559
PER --> DB : sqlite3
INI ..> PER : carga inicial
CAN ..> C1 : <<ZeroMQ/TCP>>\nPUSH-PULL :6001\n(notificación)
C1 ..> SCR : lee
C1 ..> MET1 : escribe
GT ..> MET2 : escribe

note bottom of M2
  Para la entrega final (3 máquinas), persistencia.py y srb.db
  se mueven a una Máquina 3: solo cambia la dirección del
  servicio de persistencia en config.json.
end note
@enduml
